12
01:02:31,578 --> 01:02:37,578
It had its world premiere on March 17, 2015 at South by Southwest and stars Henry Rollins as Jack, an
immortal, cannibalistic loner who has withdrawn from society to protect both himself and others.

13
01:07:44,210 --> 01:07:50,210
Plans were announced to create a direct sequel and
miniseries expansion following the character Jack.

14
01:12:56,842 --> 01:13:02,842
The script for this was later rewritten to create the 2019 film She Never Died.

15
01:18:09,473 --> 01:18:15,473
Filming for He Never Died began in November 2013 in Toronto
and concluded in December of the same year.

16
01:23:22,105 --> 01:23:28,105
The film was released on various video on demand platforms as well as on DVD
and became available worldwide on Netflix on March 18, 2016.

17
01:28:34,736 --> 01:28:40,736
The film explores themes of vampire, bible, flesh eating,
immortal, father daughter relationship.

18
01:33:47,368 --> 01:33:53,368
The tone is dark and lighthearted and emotional.
